(a) No license controlled by this chapter shall be issued to any person, firm or corporation to sell or offer to sell:
(1) Distilled spirits in or within:
a. One hundred (100) yards of any church property, as defined in this chapter;
b. Two hundred (200) yards of any school building, educational building, school property or college campus;
