(2) On the North side of Martin Luther King, Jr., Blvd between Church and North/South Washington Streets;
(3) On any of the connecting streets South of West/East Gaines Street and North of Martin Luther King, Jr., Blvd in the area described above;
(4) On either side of Hillcrest Parkway from Brookhaven Drive to Veterans Boulevard;
(5) On either side of Shamrock Drive from Moss Creek Lane to Hillcrest Parkway.
